  "problem": {
    "statement": "After updating from Deno 2.7.4 to 2.7.7, using node:fs.cp from one allow read directory into another allow read-write directory bubbles read requests up to /home directory. When these are now ignored, the entire operation fails.\n\nTo reproduce, clone this repo: https://github.com/Sytm/deno-test and then run `deno task callback` on v2.7.4 and then on v2.7.7.\n\nOn 2.7.4, this operation works, despite ignoring read requests to directories higher in the hierarchy, but when ignoring these read requests on v2.7.7, it no longer works.\n\nVersion: Deno 2.7.7",
    "source": "issue",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/32923",
    "source_id": 32923
  },
